    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sliding window (at most k bad)</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/max-consecutive-ones-iii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1004</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Max Consecutive Ones III</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Do not think about which zeros to flip: find the longest window that contains at most k zeros. Grow the right edge every step, move the left edge only while the window holds more than k zeros. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
